# hair/adult/longloose_hang: Long loose's hanging ends: on the shoulders in front, down the back to the shoulder blades (hair keys)
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; to HAIR in wave 2). On the adult head box (STYLE_P2 21). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
